<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin 9-month T-bill average yield 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin 9-month T-bill average yield 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yield at an auction of Slovak Finance Ministry nine-month treasury bills, the first of such a maturity this year, hit 9.3 percent, the National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					   Oct 30</p>
<p> Bids (billion crowns)	     5.220</p>
<p> Bids accepted			 3.570</p>
<p> Minimum yield (pct)		 9.200</p>
<p> Average yield (pct)		 9.307</p>
<p> Maximum yield (pct)		 9.400</p>
<p> Maturity date		   July 31, 1997</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
